                    Vietnam Country Files, Vietnam, Vol. I, Through 3/19/69. Secret. Nixon wrote “Excellent” on the memorandum.
                        Kissinger sent an identical
                    memorandum to Rogers dated January 28.
                    (Ibid., RG 59, Central Files 1967–69, POL 1 US–VIET S)</p>
